I can help — this is a great checklist to bring to your annual physical. A couple quick clarifying questions before I finalize recommendations:
- You said “my last blood pressure was 72%.” Do you mean 72 mmHg (systolic or diastolic), 72/??, or something else (e.g., “72% of goal”)? If you can give the most recent numeric BP (systolic/diastolic) that helps.
