- A1c
- Basic metabolic panel (creatinine, electrolytes, eGFR)
- Urine albumin-to-creatinine ratio (UACR)
- Lipid panel
- Liver function tests (if starting GLP-1 or metformin later)
- ECG (if not recent, because of HF and meds)
- If indicated: BNP/NT-proBNP, repeat echocardiogram (if HF symptoms changed)
- Review CPAP download for sleep apnea adherence

6) Practical scripts you can use in the visit or a patient portal message
- To discuss BP targets and med changes:
  - “I want to make sure my blood pressure target is appropriate given my diabetes and heart failure. Is a goal of <130/80 right for me, and how aggressively should we treat it without causing dizziness or low BP? If we need to change meds, what will you recommend and how will we monitor labs?”
- To ask about SGLT2/GLP-1 or endocrinology referral:
