7) Red flags to call about before the appointment
- New or worsening lightheadedness, fainting, or falls after taking meds.
- Recurrent symptomatic hypoglycemia or severe hyperglycemia.
- Rapid weight gain (fluid retention), worsening shortness of breath, or chest pain.

