Nice—this is a good time to prepare. A few quick clarifying questions before I give a focused checklist and suggested questions to bring to Dr. Amy Foster:

- When you said “my last blood pressure was 72%,” can you clarify what that means? (Do you mean a single reading like 172/?? or 72 mmHg for pulse, or percent medication adherence, or something else?)
