- “Can we review my home BP log together? If my home readings remain elevated, would you consider ambulatory BP monitoring or adjustments to my medications?”
- “Given my diabetes and heart failure, should I be on an SGLT2 or GLP‑1? If so, can you start one or would you prefer to refer to Endocrinology?”
- “Please order A1c, BMP, lipid panel, and urine albumin/creatinine before or at this visit so we can make decisions today.”
- “If you think an endocrinology referral is appropriate, I’d like a referral to Phoenix Endocrinology — please include reason: diabetes management with cardiovascular disease/possible need for SGLT2/GLP‑1/insulin adjustment.”

