- At age 52 with type 2 diabetes and heart failure, some diabetes meds (SGLT2 inhibitors, certain GLP‑1 agents) have clear cardiovascular and heart-failure benefits. An endocrinologist can help evaluate and start these therapies if appropriate and coordinate with cardiology/PCP.
