- Review of anticoagulation (apixaban) monitoring and bleeding-risk counseling
- Review statin therapy (atorvastatin 40 mg) and LDL goal given diabetes and heart disease
- Ask about referrals for diabetes education, nutrition, and a structured BP program if needed

8) Red flags to seek immediate care
- New chest pain, severe shortness of breath, sudden weakness or speech changes
