- How should we monitor for side effects (kidney function, potassium, symptomatic low BP or dizziness, orthostatic symptoms)? How often should I get basic labs after any change?
- Given my heart failure history, should we adjust our BP targets or medications specifically to support heart failure management (and is my beta-blocker dose appropriate)?
