1) Hypertension management — questions to ask
- What blood-pressure target should we be aiming for in my case given my type 2 diabetes, history of heart failure, age (52), and sleep apnea?
- My current meds are lisinopril 20 mg (BP), metoprolol 25 mg, apixaban 5 mg twice daily, and atorvastatin 40 mg. Are any of these contributing to low blood pressure or interactions I should worry about?
