- ECG if not done recently or if heart-failure follow-up is needed
- Weight, orthostatic vitals
- Foot exam / monofilament for neuropathy
- Referral for dilated eye exam (annual retinal screening if not done)
- Vaccination review (influenza, pneumococcal, shingles per age/indication)

