- “Could you order labs today (A1c, BMP, urine albumin/creatinine, lipid panel) and consider ambulatory BP monitoring if my office vs home readings differ?”
- “Please check whether my apixaban dose remains appropriate based on my latest renal function, and whether any of the diabetes or BP medication choices would affect bleeding risk.”

